1
00:00:02,413 --> 00:00:04,413
The last item's a bralette.

2
00:00:04,413 --> 00:00:06,296
It's a super basic design,

3
00:00:06,296 --> 00:00:07,776
so let's try to knock it out quickly.

4
00:00:08,232 --> 00:00:09,327
Time's tight,

5
00:00:09,327 --> 00:00:11,148
so Eunwoo, you take the lead

6
00:00:11,148 --> 00:00:13,180
and Yubin, support her as best you can.

7
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:14,919
Got it.

8
00:00:18,839 --> 00:00:19,839
Yubin

9
00:00:21,153 --> 00:00:23,419
this one's a really simple design.

10
00:00:23,643 --> 00:00:25,563
Want to go ahead and
draft the pattern yourself?

11
00:00:26,461 --> 00:00:28,018
Sure, I can do that.

12
00:00:40,872 --> 00:00:41,872
Eunwoo

13
00:00:42,146 --> 00:00:43,334
I'm done.

14
00:00:52,792 --> 00:00:53,792
Nice work.

15
00:00:54,839 --> 00:00:56,543
Go ahead and make a sample from that.

16
00:00:56,968 --> 00:00:58,613
I'll work on the quantity estimates.

17
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:02,511
Alright.

18
00:01:24,266 --> 00:01:25,266
Eunwoo

19
00:01:25,322 --> 00:01:27,074
I'm heading to the sewing room.

20
00:01:27,627 --> 00:01:28,627
Okay.

21
00:01:30,426 --> 00:01:31,426
Yubin...

22
00:01:34,462 --> 00:01:36,976
About yesterday... I'm sorry.

23
00:01:38,713 --> 00:01:39,713
Huh?

24
00:01:40,776 --> 00:01:42,581
I was too harsh when I got mad at you.

25
00:01:45,001 --> 00:01:46,682
I was awful.

26
00:01:50,446 --> 00:01:51,446
It's okay.

27
00:01:52,167 --> 00:01:53,493
I did mess up.

28
00:01:55,001 --> 00:01:57,498
I'll do my best
not to make any more mistakes.

29
00:02:10,333 --> 00:02:12,244
But… if I may—

30
00:02:16,837 --> 00:02:19,210
I don't think quitting is the best way

31
00:02:20,211 --> 00:02:22,211
to support Hanna.

32
00:02:25,001 --> 00:02:27,042
If I really want to help her,

33
00:02:27,721 --> 00:02:29,650
I should take responsibility
for my mistakes

34
00:02:30,433 --> 00:02:32,859
and contribute more.

35
00:02:37,214 --> 00:02:38,504
I'm off to work.
